== built from the sources
This Cesia was built from its sources (cesia 1.0.0+dev): git pull and dune build bring it up to date, not cesia upgrade.
exit 1
== a lib/ that isn't Cesia's is never touched
cesia upgrade replaces a Cesia that install.sh or install.ps1 put in place, with its bin/ and lib/ side by side, and TOP/other/bin/cesia isn't one: install the new one the way this one was. Nothing changed.
keep.txt
